PARITY MAPPING  (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex)
  alertVariantMap info/success/warning/danger → AlertBannerVariantStyle: accent = statusInfo / statusSuccess /
                                 statusWarning / statusDanger; fill = accent.opacity(0.06) (web bg-X/5);
                                 stroke = accent.opacity(0.20) (web border-X/20). Title + message tinted with
                                 the accent (web titleText + text-X/80); hierarchy via font weight, not reduced
                                 contrast (keeps light/dark/high-contrast token contrast).
  flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl → HStack(alignment:.top, spacing: TSSpacing.md).padding(TSSpacing.lg)
                                 over RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: TSRadius.lg). icon shrink-0 → leading SF
                                 Symbol; title mt-0.5 → VStack(spacing: 2) with the title conditionally shown.
  lucide X (onClose)           → AlertBannerDismissButton (SF Symbol "xmark", facade a11y label, plain style)
  lucide WifiOff (offline/stale)→ "wifi.slash" (offline) / "clock.badge.exclamationmark" (stale)
  useMutationToast success/error→ AlertBannerProjection.mutationContent: success → .success variant, title-as-
                                 message, no emphasised title, dismissible; failure → .danger variant, title +
                                 err.message detail (fallback "Something went wrong."), dismissible
  LiveStaleDataBanner / OfflineBanner → connectivityContent: stale/offline → .warning, the verbatim web copy
                                 ("Live data unavailable" + the 2-minute message / "You're offline" + the
                                 cached-data message), NOT dismissible (web companions auto-hide on reconnect)
  i18n                         → every shipped string via AlertBannerStrings (NSLocalizedString table
                                 "AlertBanner", web literal as the value: fallback). No English literals in the
                                 shipped UI files (Adapter / Model / Views / AlertBanner.swift).
  a11y                         → banner title+message combined into one element with an explicit
                                 "{title}: {message}" label (AlertBannerAccessibility); dismiss / retry / chip
                                 each labelled; icons accessibilityHidden; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce
                                 Motion via TSFadeIn + the guarded skeleton shimmer.
  telemetry                    → view.opened surface="AlertBanner" emitted once per presentation (re-armed by
                                 stop(), matching the web mount/unmount lifecycle) per P1/S11.

STATES (every state renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → reduce-motion-aware skeleton banner chrome (the source is resolving the alert condition).
  empty    → live + no active alert → a friendly "No active alerts." glass state, never a blank box.
  error    → the source itself failed → a danger-tinted box with a retry affordance (model.refresh()).
  alert    → an active alert: a mutation result (success → success / failure → danger) OR a connectivity
             warning (stale / offline → the LiveStaleDataBanner / OfflineBanner copy), in the web variant
             composition (icon · optional title · message · optional dismiss).
  stale    → freshness chip + the warning banner + a one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → freshness chip + the warning banner over cached content; no auto-refresh.

